      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_aku_020_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "B400CD87B965F759",
      "text": "I see you took care of the guards. Nice work.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_aku_020_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "B400CA87B965F240",
      "text": "Now, holed up in that base is Team Star’s Dark\\ncrew—the Segin Squad.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_aku_020_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "B400CB87B965F3F3",
      "text": "Their boss, Giacomo, pretty much runs the whole\\nof Team Star, and he also produced that wild\\r\\nsoundtrack of theirs himself.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_aku_020_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "B400D087B965FC72",
      "text": "He’s a sharp guy. Even our declaration of war\\nwon’t have ruffled him in the slightest.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_aku_020_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "B400D187B965FE25",
      "text": "His plan is probably to wear you down with a\\nwave of grunts, then finish you off himself.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_aku_020_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "B400CE87B965F90C",
      "text": "No use trying to outthink strategic types like him.\\nBring him down with a head-on attack![VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_aku_020_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "B400CF87B965FABF",
      "text": "Just keep on defeating as many Pokémon as you\\ncan until the big man himself shows up.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
